1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,164
Iklan jalan, chat masuk,
tapi sebagian spam.

2
00:00:03,164 --> 00:00:06,808
Dibalas satu-satu, waktu CS habis,
dan budget iklan bocor.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,347
Ini chat spam, tapi datangnya lewat iklan.

4
00:00:10,347 --> 00:00:11,114
Jangan dibalas.

5
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,562
Tandai dengan label Spam.

6
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,761
Ubah tahapnya jadi Loss.

7
00:00:18,761 --> 00:00:21,937
Tidak ada event ke Meta, jadi
laporan lead tetap bersih.

8
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,275
Di Leads, filter status Loss, lalu ekspor.

9
00:00:26,275 --> 00:00:28,573
Ini daftar nomor yang mau dikecualikan.

10
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:33,605
Di Meta, buat Custom Audience
dari customer list.

11
00:00:33,605 --> 00:00:34,770
Unggah daftar tadi.

12
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,890
Di ad set, kecualikan audiens itu.

13
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,725
Iklan berhenti menjangkau mereka!

14
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,954
Budget kembali ke calon pembeli
asli, bukan ke spam.

15
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,572
Jangan balas spam, cukup tandai.

16
00:00:53,572 --> 00:00:57,061
Perbarui audiens pengecualiannya tiap
minggu dari ekspor Leads.

17
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,740
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
